{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110574","id":3422465249,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7L_qzh","number":110574,"title":"Static variables are not visibile in the debugger / inspector","user":{"login":"DaveInDev","id":20345939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzQ1OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20345939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveInDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveInDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-09-16T14:08:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T16:08:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-12T16:08:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible at least in 4.4.1 and 4.5 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (6 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you add a static variable into a class or scene, you won't be able to inspect this static variable into the debugger Stack Trace that only show local members of the current object.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInclude a static variable into a scene or class, and try to inspect it while debugging (in a breakpoint for example)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[staticvariabledebbuging.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22364461/staticvariabledebbuging.zip)\n\nput a breakpoint into the ready function of the sub-scene and try to inspect the static variable.\nNothing in the context help : \n<img width=\"537\" height=\"210\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/360f0516-40b4-4445-b6a4-6fe0e852d976\" />\n\nand nothing in the stack trace : \n<img width=\"676\" height=\"157\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01c7d12f-7ce6-46d1-9fc0-0b5b30bf15b4\" />\n\nNote that the local variable is inspectable : \n<img width=\"423\" height=\"142\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36bddccc-ee5d-46db-9477-ef23fcf1fd8a\" />\n\nStatic variable should appear in 3 places : \n- the context help/tooltip\n- the stack trace\n- in the inspector, maybe in a \"static\" group, close to the \"member\" group.","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110574/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}